		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Zombie corpse of zygomind fungus victim. Inoculated with mind-controlling spores.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +1 (1d6 + fascination spores), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> -2, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fascination Spores</strong>. Creatures within close of zygomind zombie that are exposed to spores, CHA 12+ or stupefied for 1 day, unable to act, move towards zygomind and lay down.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
